<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><em>In endless nights of love,<br />
A great delight that comes about,<br />
The pains and bothers are banished<br />
Happy, happy to die of love.</em></p>
</div>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kFzViYkZAz4">Recommended Reading Music: La Vie en Rose</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Alternative Title <em>'Je Vois La Vie en Rose'</em></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="/hotcoles">Enjoyed this SCP? Click here to check out more of my work on my Author Page!</a></p>
<hr />
<p>I seriously cannot stress how much I have enjoyed crafting this piece. The Queen is likely among one of the best characters I have ever crafted. I seriously couldn't have done this without my co-author and partner in crime <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3487700); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542908278" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3487700); return false;">Uncle Nicolini</a></span> who greatly helped me in creating this when the article was nothing but a garden that made you happy. Check out his author page <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/uncle-nicolini-author-page">here.</a></p>
<p>We went through a <em>lot</em> of ideas for this piece. Originally, this was nothing but an article about a rose garden that would cause people to become extremely happy and eventually undergo a compulsion to return to the garden and explode into rose petals. We scrapped this idea after getting advice from one of our critics. The concept of the Queen came to my mind when I was doing yard work and looked at my rose bush, which honestly is pretty neat when I think about.</p>
